              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Y6Ln7",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "Pages — pyramid",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "l0jnb7",
              "name": "Rule",
              "fill": "$ink-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "apps/pyramid, not built yet. Reference only, never joined. The pages as decided on 20 Nov 2026, in the BI shell decided on 21 Nov (Q30–Q37: sidebar of layers and workspaces, top bar with search, filter row, no footer): / and /[workspace] in light and dark at 1280 and 390, with the filtered, stale, empty and unmeasured states.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "u3L7s",
          "name": "Section / — the repository, as a dashboard",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "HMVKT",
              "name": "st",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "/ — the repository, as a dashboard",
              "lineHeight": 1.25,
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": 24,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "G5lSL",
              "name": "note wrap",
              "width": 1100,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ii8L2",
                  "name": "note",
                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Drill-down: a click on a pyramid band, a donut segment or a layer option filters the page in place and writes the filter to the URL (the filtered frames, /?layer=unit). Drill-through: a workspace name opens its page. The classic shape: many unit tests at the base, integration (component) in the middle, end-to-end (acceptance) at the top. Each band fills with the share of its subjects that are measured. Stale: older than 14 days (Q2). Sample data: main at 0514dc9, 20 Nov 2026.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
